<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Noodle Kidoodle said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Noodle Kidoodle said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber downgraded Noodle Kidoodle Inc to neutral from buy, a PaineWebber source said.</p>
<p>-- Earlier today, Noodle Kidoodle reported that its same-store sales for the eight-week holiday season fell by two percent.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1-1/4 to 4-5/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
